   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">We have invested into Lona Group alongside a consortium including Phatisa Food Fund 2, Finnfund and Norfund, to continue the development of Lona Group into a diversified, vertically-integrated food business. The investment will support Lona Group in creating enhanced economic opportunities in some of South Africa?s poorest areas, primarily for 500 low-income workers involved in the group?s farming, manufacturing, and food processing operations, by supporting the business?s expansion.</narrative>
   </description>
